    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Working on materialized content — copy it out",
      "prov:value": "**Materialized content is a copy of somebody else's bytes, and this repository\ndoes not edit it in place.** The owner, 2026-09-21:\n\n> *\"if we have a materialized `<stub>/<sub-graph>`, the contents of it should be\n> immutable … you would need to copy/materialize it to your own `folio/` in\n> order to mess around with it.\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Working on materialized content — copy it out",
      "prov:value": "And 2026-09-22, choosing between advising and enforcing: **enforce from the\nstart.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who may copy out",
      "prov:value": "**Any reader** — the owner's ruling, 2026-09-22. This is deliberately not a\npermission: refusing a copy would not protect the original, because the\noriginal is protected by being read-only.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the copy goes",
      "prov:value": "**Into the copier's own `folio/`, with provenance** — owner's ruling,\n2026-09-22, chosen over a scratch area.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The copy records what it is a copy of",
      "prov:value": "It does not overwrite `upstream`, and it does not\nreuse `upstream` for the local original — that was one field until 2026-09-22,\nand by then 5 of the 9 the IRIS replica item records were using it for a local value in\nviolation of its own documentation.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The exception is \"say what you did\", not a list of who may skip",
      "prov:value": "The owner's exception is *\"expect for publication worfklow purposes or so\"*."
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where this bites, measured",
      "prov:value": "### Where this bites, measured"
    },
    {
      "@id": "library/skills/large-datasets/copy-out-materialized.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "And where it does NOT bite, also measured",
      "prov:value": "A\ndeclared-but-absent step is the `dh4f` defect: a consumer scans it and reports a\nclean run over nothing."
    }
  ]
